#. module: ab_ai_command
#: model:ai.agent.tool,description:ab_ai_command.tool_run_command
msgid ""
"Create a DRAFT business document (quotation, purchase request, employee) "
"from what the user asked for. Pass `command` (e.g. create_quote) plus "
"`fields` you extracted — partner/vendor name, date, and items as free text "
"like \"2x latte, 1 espresso\". Alternatively pass the raw `text` when the "
"user typed a slash command. It only ever creates a draft; it never confirms "
"or posts. When it returns needs_input, ask the user ONLY the listed "
"questions and offer any options verbatim — never choose for them."
msgstr ""

